      "id": "project-one-id",
      "title": "Publication Compiler",
      "slug": "project-one",
      "bodyHtml": "<h2>Durable publishing</h2><p>Canonical snapshots keep deployments reproducible without coupling the website to its authoring service.</p><blockquote><p>Publishing is a boundary, not a runtime dependency.</p></blockquote>",
      "type": "project",
      "tags": ["typescript", "aws", "systems"],
